flowchart TD
  Start[Choose current open schedule] --> Mode{Primary or support?}
  Mode --> Upload[Upload original with validated document type]
  Upload --> Sheet{Collection or sales sheet?}
  Sheet -->|Yes| Manual[Enter values manually]
  Sheet -->|No| OCR[Bounded PaddleOCR extraction]
  OCR --> Result{Readable result?}
  Result -->|No| Manual
  Result -->|Yes| Review[Edit predictions beside original]
  Manual --> Review
  Review --> Confirm[Explicit review then finance editor]
  Confirm --> Save{Access / dates / versions / amounts valid?}
  Save -->|No| Resolve[Keep draft and show validation or latest record]
  Resolve --> Confirm
  Save -->|Yes| Commit[Atomic save and affected verification clearing]
  Commit --> Flags[Recompute support / mismatch / outstanding]
  Flags --> Auditor[Auditor reviews original and current version]
  Auditor --> Decision[Append verification decision]
